flowchart TB
  A["<b>1. Each DAO's council votes a pledge</b><br/>the DAO files its own Transfer proposal to Lockstep<br/>anyone registers it; no money moves"]
  B["<b>2. The page computes the gap</b><br/>max-flow over pledges and permitted lines,<br/>with a min-cut certificate anyone can recheck"]
  C["<b>3. Anyone tops up the exact gap</b><br/>ft_transfer_call, held in escrow by lockstep-v2.testnet"]
  D["<b>4. activate(allocation)</b><br/>every line covered exactly, each pledge within its cap"]
  E["<b>5. collect, on each DAO</b><br/>Lockstep approves the DAO's own proposal<br/>with a role that may only approve<br/>it keeps the share; the rest goes back"]
  F{"Did every share arrive?"}
  G["<b>Settled</b><br/>disburse pays every payee"]
  H["<b>Rolled back</b><br/>disburse refunds everything that arrived"]
  A --> B --> C --> D --> E --> F
  F -->|"yes"| G
  F -->|"a share Failed (check_share)"| H
